# Relationship to existing work

- #30 PORTFOLIO-0001 contains an earlier Git-native DAG/control-plane design; this project supersedes its idea→task shortcut with an explicit RP/research/synthesis gate while reusing useful manifest/DAG concepts.
- #31 PENTAGI becomes the first natural external-portfolio-company case study.
- #102 defines internal Mindrock management roles.
- #105 defines LP inference/contribution side.
- #100 supplies Founder/agent SSI semantics.
- #108/#109 establish a candidate external sovereign-worker boundary.

# Candidate first bounded successor

`PROJECT-OFFICE-0001 — shadow one project through RP → 2 research reports → synthesis → founder charter`

Use a synthetic/non-sensitive pilot and do not deploy a real founder scheduler initially. Vimana may be used as a speculative test fixture only if clearly labeled unvalidated.

